---
source: tests/config_validation.rs
expression: err
---
source.toml:1:1 sources.missing: missing required key "urls"
source.toml:5:9 sources.no_list.urls[0]: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ" is not a playlist or channel URL: use a playlist (with list=<playlist id>) or a channel (/@handle, /channel/UC…, /c/name, /user/name)
source.toml:8:9 sources.bare_id.urls[0]: "PLcccccccc" is not a URL; use the playlist's or channel's URL (e.g. "https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxxxxxxxx" or "https://www.youtube.com/@channel")
source.toml:11:9 sources.not_youtube.urls[0]: "https://example.com/playlist?list=PLdddddddd" is not a YouTube URL (e.g. "https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxxxxxxxx" or "https://www.youtube.com/@channel")
source.toml:15:12 sources.bad_category.category: "Music!" isn't a category name: use lowercase letters, digits, '-' and '_'
source.toml:18:8 sources.not_a_list.urls: must be a list of URLs, e.g. urls = ["https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLeeeeeeee"]
source.toml:21:8 sources.repeated.urls: has the same URL more than once
